"And it's just like mine!\p"
"Do you know about POKéNAV's\n"
"MATCH CALL system?\p"
"Access it, and you can chat with\n"
"registered TRAINERS anytime.\p"
"It also shows you which TRAINERS\n"
"want a rematch with you.\p"
"It's really nifty! Those DEVON guys\n"
"sure know what they're doing!$"
